[x] state  - error         -> DlqInspectorState.Error (list query failed): DlqInspectorPageViewModel.ShowListError +
             IsListError → DLQInspectorPage.cs#Render shows _listError (TsQueryError InfoBar + Retry via ActionInvoked
             → RefreshAsync) and the freshness chip IsError ("Error"); the HTTP-403 replay gate raises the
             replay-blocked TsAlertBanner (DlqInspectorPageViewModel.ReplayDisabledBannerVisible); tests
             LoadAsync_ListFailure_ReachesErrorState + Replay_Http403_RaisesTheBanner + DismissReplayBanner_HidesIt
