             StatusHeader tiles + the entries table + the audit table from the bound StatusModel/EntriesModel/
             AuditModel, ListUpdatedAt drives the freshness chip ("Live"); tests
             LoadAsync_Success_ReachesReadyState_AndProjectsChildModels + Inspect_OpensTheDrawer_AndLoadsTheFullEntry
             + Replay_RequestRaisesConfirm_AndOkOutcomeClosesDrawer_NoBanner

